                     /note="Carries out transcription and genome replication
                     inside a large icosahedral complex formed with 4 other
                     viral proteins (inner core). However, purified P2 protein
                     is active. Accepts single and double-stranded RNA as
                     templates and is capable of de novo initiation.
                     Structurally related to Hepatitis C virus RdRP. other
                     names: P2."
